@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Sale Process

[*] --> Start

state "Start" as Start
state "Waiting for sale" as WaitingForSale
state "Adding items" as AddingItems
state "Payment processing" as PaymentProcessing
state "Cash payment approved" as CashPaymentApproved
state "Card/Check payment verified" as CardCheckPaymentVerified
state "Sale completed" as SaleCompleted
state "Back to waiting" as BackToWaiting

Start --> WaitingForSale : Start new sale

WaitingForSale --> AddingItems : Add items begins

AddingItems --> PaymentProcessing : All items added

PaymentProcessing --> CashPaymentApproved : Cash payment chosen
PaymentProcessing --> CardCheckPaymentVerified : Card/Check payment chosen

CashPaymentApproved --> SaleCompleted : Cash payment completed
CardCheckPaymentVerified --> SaleCompleted : Card/Check payment approved

SaleCompleted --> BackToWaiting : Return to waiting

BackToWaiting --> [*]

@enduml
